{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788313689400685001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"dusty-wooded-dog","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"ce6dcf28cdcd0d8af515fdea7c6d47d4817fa583ebda0a0b9e60bcc2b45d3747","event_uuid":"5a743e41-69cb-4bf0-98f6-8a6ae82b9859","position":{"commit_sha":"7d4b1806342d45c36ab6937eb455733d58cf6d86","position":"1788311273475283001-5a743e41-69cb-4bf0-98f6-8a6ae82b9859"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"1023deb81894359443ffa113650027d220b91e3068b6bc6b45b51358b3dff27b","event_uuid":"e360d879-f5df-4da0-9b1f-1218fdf3d11a","position":{"commit_sha":"72671726579bf7cd1bb1e19db7d2770910e148aa","position":"1788311281019075001-e360d879-f5df-4da0-9b1f-1218fdf3d11a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788311273475283001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\n`src/rebar/_mcp_health.py:103-789` aggregates startup handshake, instrumentation, health routing, request lifecycle, transport, and shutdown at 789 lines. The maintainer approved only the cohesive handshake extraction, not a broader lifecycle redesign.\n\n## Approach\n\nMove the existing startup-handshake call-graph cluster into one focused sibling module. Keep `_mcp_health` as the compatibility and orchestration facade and retain its existing handshake exports. This buys module headroom while minimizing operational behavior change.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/_mcp_health.py`\n- new focused handshake sibling under `src/rebar/`\n- `src/rebar/mcp_server.py` only if import wiring requires it\n- MCP startup/health tests\n\nCascade flag: true. Recensus semantic, string, dynamic import, and monkeypatch references before moving symbols.\n\n## Testing\n\nPreserve successful and failed startup handshakes, signer binding, route readiness, offload/instrumentation ordering, and shutdown/transport behavior through the existing focused suites.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Only the cohesive startup-handshake cluster is extracted and `_mcp_health` remains the lifecycle/orchestration facade.\n- [ ] Existing handshake symbols and public/dynamic patch targets continue resolving through `_mcp_health`.\n- [ ] `wire_health` ordering, health routes, signer binding, instrumentation/offload, SIGTERM, transport, and shutdown behavior are unchanged.\n- [ ] MCP startup-handshake and health-store suites plus module-size and complexity gates pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_mcp_health.py","reason":"extract only the startup-handshake call graph and retain facade wiring"},{"path":"src/rebar/_mcp_startup_handshake.py","reason":"new focused owner for the existing handshake cluster"},{"path":"src/rebar/mcp_server.py","reason":"preserve server wiring if import ownership changes"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_mcp_health_startup_handshake.py","reason":"prove startup success/failure and ordering"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_mcp_health_store_status.py","reason":"guard health-route and store-state behavior"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["janitor","mcp","refactor","rp07"],"ticket_id":"4ac6-9eb3-b0a5-408f","ticket_type":"story","title":"Extract only the MCP startup-handshake call-graph unit","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["5a743e41-69cb-4bf0-98f6-8a6ae82b9859","e360d879-f5df-4da0-9b1f-1218fdf3d11a"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788313689400685001,"uuid":"afe00196-2042-4f75-becc-b84723b9be44"}